```console
$ scherzo-cloud run inputs delete --help
Make retained input content logically unavailable and schedule cleanup

Usage: scherzo-cloud run inputs delete [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUN>           Exact Run ID

Options:
      --yes                            Confirm logical unavailability and scheduled content cleanup
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
      --json                           Write one JSON result to standard output
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
